; PENDING-DIAGNOSTIC [INFO] PENDING-RELEASE-GUARD: release is evaluated only after completion goal 67 is reached
; PENDING-DIAGNOSTIC [INFO] PENDING-ACTION-WITNESS-SEPARATE: action 'build' is not treated as completion evidence; witness 'building-type-count' owns completion
; PENDING-DIAGNOSTIC [INFO] PENDING-RELEASE-SEPARATE: release remains separate from witness 'building-type-count' and may clear the demand only from complete state
; Issuance failure: economy-farm-floor-feudal-4 | RETAIN-ACTIVE
